              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Icbocet wod pa Caulo owinyo ni Abneri doŋ gineko woko i Kebron, ci kome oto woko lirut, ki cwiny jo Icrael bene oballe woko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno onoŋo Icbocet tye ki lutel wi buca monnye aryo; nyiŋ ŋat acel Baana ki nyiŋ mukene: Rekab. Gin ducu awobe pa Rimmon ma jo Benjamin, gaŋ tugi Beerot. Beerot gikwano bot jo Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Beerot kikome guriŋo gularo i Gitaim, ci gudoko lubedo kunnu nio wa i kare man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
