              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 9.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonacan wod pa Caulo yam tye ki wode mo ma tyene okwe woko. I kare ma gikelo lok ki i Jejreel i kom gin mutimme i kom Caulo ki Y onacan, onoŋo en doŋ ditte romo mwaka abic. Ci lapidine otiŋe, oriŋo kwede woko, ci latin opoto woko piny i kare ma co tye ka ŋwec matek-ki, omiyo odoko Laŋolo; nyiŋe Mepibocet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awobe pa Rimmon ma jo Beerot, Rekab ki Baana, gua ci gucito ki i cwiny dyeceŋ malyet-ti, gucito wa i ot pa Icbocet i kare ma en tye ka yweyo i dyeceŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo lagwok doggola obedo ka pyeto nano, ci nino omako waŋe, onino woko; omiyo Rekab ki ominne Baana gulwitte gudonyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gudonyo i ot, gunoŋo Icbocet obuto i ot butone i wi kitandane, ci gucobo, guneko woko, ka guŋolo wiye. Gutiŋo wiye, gulubo kwede yo Araba dyeworwor, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci gukelo wi Icbocet bot Daudi i Kebron, guwaco bot kabaka ni, “Wi Icbocet wod pa Caulo doŋ wakelo ene, wod pa Caulo ma lamerokki ma yam mito neki, Rwot doŋ oculo kworri tin, rwotwa, i kom Caulo ki i kom litinone.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Daudi ogamo dog Rekab ki ominne Baana, awobe pa Rimmon ma jo Beerot ni, “Macalo Rwot tye makwo-ni, ma yam olaro kwona ki i ciŋ lumerokka ducu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.1+2SA.1.2+2SA.1.3+2SA.1.4+2SA.1.5+2SA.1.6+2SA.1.7+2SA.1.8+2SA.1.9+2SA.1.10+2SA.1.11+2SA.1.12+2SA.1.13+2SA.1.14+2SA.1.15+2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 1.1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i kare ma yam dano mo obino otitta lok ni, ‘Nen ba, Caulo doŋ oto woko,’ ma onoŋo en tamo ni ekella lok maber, ci an amake aneke woko i Jiklag; meno aye obedo mot ma amiyo bote pi lok ma okelo-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lok man doŋ dit makato ducu, ka ce lutim aranyi doŋ guneko dano ma cwinye leŋ ki i ode i wi kitandane, ci wutamo ni an pe abiculo kworre i komwu, atyekowu wo ko ki i wi lobo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Daudi ociko litino orobone, guneko jo-nu woko, guŋolo cing: ki tyengi woko, ka gunabo komgi i ŋet kulu me Kebron. Ento gukwanyo wi Icbocet, guyiko Lyel pa Abneri i Kebron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
